msgid "Share permission checks across paths"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To apply a permission check to many paths without repeating it in every "
"permission set, mark the permission as shared.\n"
"{project-name} always applies a shared permission when its path matches, in "
"addition to the most specific unshared permission."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For unshared permission checks, only one path match is applied, the most "
"specific one.\n"
"When a path matches as the most specific, you can specify multiple "
"permissions for that path and they are all applied."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The <<custom-http-security-policy,custom policy>> named `custom` is also "
"applied on the `/admin/1` path, together with the `admin-policy1` policy."
msgstr ""

